WIRE STRIPPER COMPARISON

TYPE A: MANUAL
variables:
  design        = simple
  cost          = budget-friendly
  weight        = lightweight
  power         = none required
  best_for      = home use, light work, small wiring projects
fundamentals:
  easy to carry
  always ready
  low complexity

TYPE B: AUTOMATIC
variables:
  speed         = fast & accurate
  adjustability = yes (multiple wire sizes)
  effort        = reduced (less hand fatigue)
  extra         = built-in cutter
  best_for      = professional work, frequent use, various sizes
fundamentals:
  strips in seconds
  consistent results
  higher throughput
